# Read-mode combo — exact mechanism anchors plus scalar retry budget
#
# Covers mechanism-anchor preservation together with a scalar identifier. The
# answer must not drift from the retry budget (`MaxRetriesPerStage`) to nearby
# attempt counters, and must keep `runTaskGraph` visible as the scheduler
# anchor.
ID="read_combo_analyze_retry_anchor"
NAME="read combo — analyze retry mechanism exact anchors"
QUESTION="读取代码说明 runTaskGraph 下 analyze 阶段如果一直没有调用 emit_analysis 会怎样重试；必须说明 MaxRetriesPerStage、dynamicAnalyzeRetries、StageOutput/Error 的关系，并说明系统是否会静默使用零值 AnalysisIR。"
EXPECT_CONTAINS="runTaskGraph emit_analysis MaxRetriesPerStage dynamicAnalyzeRetries StageOutput"
EXPECT_MATCHES_REGEX="(Error|错误|失败)
(不会|不|not).*?(零值|zero.?value|silent|静默)"
EXPECT_NOT_CONTAINS="EmitStageRetryAttempt-only-answer"

